"collapsible_item","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"What materials do you use in your furniture?","content":"<p>Our furniture is crafted from <strong>high-quality, responsibly sourced wood<\/strong>.<\/p><p>Materials may include:<\/p><ul><li>Solid wood<br\/><\/li><li>Natural or reclaimed wood (such as driftwood), depending on the design<br\/><\/li><\/ul><p>Material selection varies by product. If you would like detailed information about the wood used for a specific item, please contact our consulting team before placing your order.<\/p>","custom_liquid":"","page":"","open":false,"use_subtext_color":true}},"collapsible_item_T7zEhg":{"type":"collapsible_item","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Do you offer international shipping?","content":"<p>At this time, we ship <strong>only within the United States<\/strong>.<\/p><p>All products are manufactured by our partners in Vietnam and shipped internationally to U.S. addresses. We currently do not offer delivery to other countries.<\/p>","custom_liquid":"","page":"","open":false,"use_subtext_color":true}},"collapsible_item_jjNpea":{"type":"collapsible_item","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"How long will it take to receive my order?","content":"<p>Because our products are <strong>custom-made<\/strong>, delivery time includes both production and shipping.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Production time:<\/strong> approximately <strong>10–20 business days<\/strong><br\/><\/li><li><strong>Shipping time to the U.S.:<\/strong> approximately <strong>10–25 business days<\/strong><br\/><\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Estimated total delivery time:<\/strong> <strong>20–45 business days<\/strong> from the order date.<\/p><p>Once your order ships, you will receive a tracking number via email so you can follow its progress.<\/p><p>Please note that delivery times are estimates and may vary due to customs clearance, carrier delays, or peak seasons.<\/p>","custom_liquid":"","page":"","open":false,"use_subtext_color":true}},"collapsible_item_k99EyH"